Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.18.45-rt49 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.18.45 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.18-rt
  Head SHA1: f5219683466143e4ec38f53b52ab7786616cf72e


Or to build 3.18.45-rt49 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.18.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.18.45.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.18/patch-3.18.45-rt49.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
